@startuml HABITAT
title HABITAT — Bayesian Latent Class Analysis

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Analyst" as Analyst
artifact "Input CSV" as Input
artifact "YAML config" as ConfigFile
artifact "model.bug" as JAGSModel

package "R application (src)" {
  component "CLI orchestrator\nrun_bayesian.R" as App
  component "Configuration\nread_config()\nvalidate_config()" as Config
  component "Output setup\nwrite_output_structure()" as OutputSetup
  component "Logging\nwrite_log()" as Logging
  component "Data reader & validation\nread_data()\nvalidate_data()" as DataReader
  component "JAGS data assembly\nassemble_jags_data()\nwrite_eta_vector()\nwrite_feature_matrix()" as JAGSData
  component "Model runner\nrun_model()" as ModelRunner
  component "Post-run analysis\nsummarize_rhat()\ngenerate_pred_scores()\ngenerate_blcm_summary()" as Analysis
  component "Plotting\ngenerate_hist() (stub)" as Plotting
}

database "JAGS / R2jags" as JAGS
artifact "Output directories\nlogs / results / temp" as Outputs
artifact "Prediction scores CSV" as Predictions
artifact "MCMC summaries & diagnostics" as Diagnostics

Analyst --> App : --input / --config / --output
Input --> DataReader : read
ConfigFile --> Config : read
App --> Config : validate settings
App --> OutputSetup : create folders
OutputSetup --> Outputs : creates
App --> DataReader : validate input
DataReader --> JAGSData : validated samples
JAGSData --> ModelRunner : eta, Y, M_fit, N, K
JAGSModel --> ModelRunner : model specification
ModelRunner --> JAGS : fit Bayesian model
JAGS --> ModelRunner : samples & summary
ModelRunner --> Analysis : model output
Analysis --> Predictions : writes scores
Analysis --> Diagnostics : writes summaries
Plotting ..> Analysis : intended plotting input

App ..> Logging : progress and errors
Config ..> Logging
DataReader ..> Logging
JAGSData ..> Logging
ModelRunner ..> Logging
Analysis ..> Logging

note bottom of JAGSData
  Training rows receive observed class labels (eta);
  feature columns become the binary response matrix (Y).
end note

note bottom of Analysis
  generate_blcm_summary() is currently a placeholder.
  generate_hist() is currently an empty stub.
end note

@enduml
